# Testing

Canonical details: `AGENTS.md` → Commands.

| Layer | Command | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Unit | `npm test` | Vitest, no database — **CI blocking** |
| DB | `npm run test:db` | Needs `DATABASE_URL` — not a default agent command |
| Preview | `npm run test:preview` | Needs preview auth state |
| E2E | `npm run test:e2e` | Playwright; CI job is **`continue-on-error`** (TM1-62) |

A red E2E job is not automatically an API bug. Clerk test users and Mapbox token are still missing from CI env.
